{"version":1,"content":"<p>余香凝與田啟文昨晚（27日）一同出席電影《善男信女》慈善首映禮。</p><p>余香凝透露，家傭突然離職，令她近日忙於照顧家庭，有點手忙腳亂，幸好原定參演的新戲延後拍攝，讓她有時間親自照顧孩子及處理家務。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:40:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:09.983549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:17.449206+00:00","content_hash":"cae9b82dd7f6787dd018c9fe5724db7671a95bff6bf2d11fadd2cdcec026d8d5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}